  "name": "Question 3",
  "problem": "Simplify the statement $¬(¬P)∨¬(¬Q).$",
  "worked_solution": "Two negations in a row cancel each other out, so:\n\n- we can simplify $¬(¬P)$ to $P,$ and\n\n- we can also simplify  $¬(¬Q)$ to $Q.$\n\nTherefore, the given statement can be simplified to \n\n$$\nP∨Q.\n$$",
